      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The bench",
        "heading": "Played before it ships",
        "text": "Nothing here is drop-shipped. Every instrument is unboxed, checked, tuned and set up by hand — and if it needs a fret dressed or a head brought up to pitch, that happens before it goes anywhere.",
